Replication package for "The Determinants of Economic Growth after the Global Financial
Crisis in OECD Countries" (BSc thesis, WU Vienna, 2026), by Nik Khosravipour.

The code, text, tables and figures created for this package are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Third-party data: 02_data/raw/pwt110.dta is the Penn World Table version 11.0
(Feenstra, Inklaar and Timmer), licensed CC-BY-4.0 and redistributed here with
attribution. Please cite: Feenstra, R. C., Inklaar, R. and Timmer, M. P. (2015), "The Next
Generation of the Penn World Table", American Economic Review 105(10), 3150-3182, and the
PWT 11.0 release (https://www.rug.nl/ggdc/productivity/pwt/).
02_data/raw/wdi/ contains World Bank World Development Indicators data (CC-BY-4.0).
